  {
    "id": "3818062651",
    "isSimulated": false,
    "title": "Pixel Skies: 8-Phase Day & Night Cycle-像素流云：昼夜八刻",
    "description": "☁️ **《流云八境 · 昼夜天色》/ 8 Skies: Drifting Hours** ☁️\n\n---\n\n美术资产来源：CraftPix.net\n\n---\n\n### ✦ 画面介绍 (Introduction)\n这是一面关于「时间与天空」的像素动态壁纸。\n\n在辽阔的苍穹之下，云层缓缓飘动，天色在八个不同的时刻之间静静更迭——\n从晨光微熹到正午蔚蓝，从日暮晚霞到午夜繁星。\n没有繁复的元素，只留下一整天舒缓流转的云海，陪伴你的工作与休憩时光。\n\n---\n\n### ✦ 壁纸特性 (Features)\n- 🎨 **8 组手绘像素天空**：涵盖清晨、正午、晚霞、落日、幽夜等 8 种独特的光影调色与氛围。\n- ☁️ **双层视差平滑滚动**：近景与远景云层以不同速率徐徐飘移，带来细腻的景深与流动感。\n- ⏳ **无缝丝滑轮播**：跨越不同时段时，云层位置始终无缝重合，伴随平滑的淡入淡出优雅换天。\n- 🕹️ **纯粹像素美学**：采用最近邻点采样与整倍数渲染，像素边缘清晰锐利，无模糊失真。\n- 🍃 **极低性能开销**：轻量级底层着色器驱动，日常待机 GPU 占用几乎为 0，静音且不耗电。\n\n---\n\n### ✦ 创作杂谈 (Behind the Scene)\n本壁纸的天空资产源自作者此前制作的一款像素钟表互动小游戏。\n我们将指针拨动的交互隐去，把这片纯净的云海单独提取并雕琢成了这面壁纸。\n希望这片不断循环的天空，能为你的桌面带来片刻平静。\n\n---\n\n🏷️ **Tags / 标签**：\n`Pixel Art` `Sky` `Clouds` `Parallax` `Day and Night` `Cozy` `Lo-Fi` `Minimalist` `像素风` `动态天空` `治愈`\n\n☁️ **8 Skies: Drifting Hours | Pixel Art Day & Night Cycle** ☁️\n\n---\n\n### Visual Assets by CraftPix.net\n\n---\n\n### ✦ Introduction\nA peaceful, ambient pixel-art wallpaper capturing the quiet passage of time across an endless sky.\n\nBeneath the vast horizon, clouds drift softly as the atmosphere gently transforms through eight distinct moments of the day—  \nfrom the cool mist of early dawn to the radiant midday blue, glowing sunset twilight, and starry midnight calm.  \n\nFree of clutter and distractions, it offers a gentle, living canvas of drifting clouds to accompany your work, study, and late-night thoughts.\n\n---\n\n### ✦ Features\n- 🎨 **8 Handcrafted Pixel Skies**: Carefully curated color palettes and lighting for dawn, noon, golden hour, dusk, midnight, and everything in between.\n- ☁️ **Dual-Layer Parallax Drift**: Near and far cloud layers glide at different speeds, creating subtle depth and a cozy sense of motion.\n- ⏳ **Seamless Cyclic Transitions**: Clouds stay perfectly aligned down to the sub-pixel as skies crossfade smoothly, ensuring zero positional jumps between phases.\n- 🕹️ **Crisp Pixel-Perfect Aesthetic**: Rendered with point-sampling (nearest neighbor) and integer scaling—keeping the pixel art razor-sharp without any blurry scaling artifacts.\n- 🍃 **Ultra-Low Resource Usage**: Driven by lightweight native GPU shaders. Idle GPU consumption is near 0%, making it silent and battery-friendly.\n\n---\n\n### ✦ Behind the Scene\nThe sky assets were originally developed for an interactive pixel clock project made in Godot.  \nBy stripping away the clock hands and UI, this wallpaper isolates the living atmosphere into an uninterrupted, meditative loop.  \n\nI hope these drifting clouds bring a touch of peace and calm to your everyday desktop.\n\n---\n\n🏷️ **Tags**:  \n`Pixel Art` `Sky` `Clouds` `Parallax` `Day & Night` `Lo-Fi` `Cozy` `Minimalist` `Chill` `Atmospheric` `Relaxing`",
    "author": {
